  "description": "Notification Assistant Workflow automatically understands requests for notifying users, identifies the right CRM record and corresponding recipients such as the assignee, owner, or primary contact, crafts a clear message, and delivers it instantly through the chosen channel like Bell, Email, or Mobile Push notification and ensuring the right person receives the right update at the right time.",
